<Layout title="PresciaIQ Review: Real Client Results from Australian Businesses"
  description="An honest review of PresciaIQ's AI services — including real results from Australian clients across construction, marketing, e-commerce, and trades.">
  <div class="pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <a href="/insights" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-8 font-sans">
        &larr; Back to Insights
      </a>
      <div class="glass-card p-8 md:p-12">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground font-sans">
          <span class="text-primary font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs">About PresciaIQ</span>
          <span>&bull; July 2026</span>
          <span>&bull; 6 min read</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-foreground mb-8 leading-tight">PresciaIQ Review: Real Client Results from Australian Businesses</h1>
        <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none font-sans text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          
          <p>We're aware that writing a review of your own company is an inherently awkward exercise. So we'll keep this factual: what we built for each client, what the measurable outcome was, and what we'd do differently. No testimonial padding, no vague claims about "transforming businesses."</p>
          <h2>BuildHire: Equipment Hire Platform</h2>
          <p>BuildHire came to us needing a digital platform that could handle instant quoting, date-picker booking logic, and fleet management for their equipment hire business. The previous website was a static brochure site with no online booking capability, which meant every enquiry required a phone call and a manual quote.</p>
          <p>We built a full-stack React platform with real-time availability checking, instant quote generation based on hire duration and equipment type, and a fleet management dashboard. The platform went live in 8 weeks. Within 90 days, BuildHire's online booking rate went from 0% to 43% of total bookings, and average quote-to-booking time dropped from 2.3 days to 4 hours.</p>
          <h2>Longevity Australia: E-Commerce Platform</h2>
          <p>Longevity Australia needed a platform that could handle the complexity of research-grade peptide e-commerce — age verification, complex bundle logic, clinical credibility, and Stripe integration — while maintaining the trust signals required for a health product in a regulated category.</p>
          <p>We built a Next.js platform with custom bundle logic, age-gating, and a clinical design system. The platform launched on schedule and has maintained a sub-2-second load time across all pages. Longevity's conversion rate on the new platform is 2.1x higher than on their previous WooCommerce site.</p>
          <h2>Loop Consulting Group: Corporate Website</h2>
          <p>Loop needed a website that would position them as a premium B2B consulting firm to enterprise clients — not a small agency. The brief was "executive-level" and the audience was CFOs and COOs at ASX-listed companies.</p>
          <p>We built a Next.js site with Framer Motion animations, a dark editorial design system, and a content architecture designed around the decision-making journey of a senior executive evaluating a consulting partner. Loop reported a measurable lift in inbound enterprise enquiries within 60 days of launch.</p>
          <h2>What We'd Do Differently</h2>
          <p>On the BuildHire project, we underestimated the complexity of the fleet management backend and had to extend the timeline by 2 weeks. We've since built a more robust scoping process for projects with complex inventory logic. On the Longevity project, the initial age-verification implementation had edge cases we didn't catch in testing — we fixed them within 48 hours of launch, but we now include more comprehensive edge-case testing as a standard part of our QA process.</p>
          <p>If you want to discuss a project, <a href="/start" class="text-primary hover:underline">start here</a>.</p>
        
        </div>
        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-border">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-bold text-lg">
              M
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-foreground font-sans">Macauley Burke</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground font-sans">Co-Founder & Head of Growth, PresciaIQ</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-foreground mb-3">Ready to eliminate the Reaction Tax?</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground font-sans mb-6">Book a free 15-minute strategy call with our Sydney team. We'll map your operational bottlenecks and calculate your AI ROI.</p>
        <a href="/start" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors font-sans">
          Book a Free Strategy Call &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
